sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Super App UI
    participant Go as Go backend / proxy
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant LDAP as LDAP / OU
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant MFE as Superset micro frontend
    participant SS as Superset Operation

    User->>UI: Click Login
    UI->>Go: GET /api/auth/login
    Go->>KC: Redirect to Authorization Code Flow
    KC->>LDAP: Authenticate user by LDAP / OU
    LDAP-->>KC: User verified
    KC-->>Go: GET /api/auth/callback?code=...
    Go->>KC: Exchange code for tokens
    Go->>KC: Fetch userinfo
    Go->>Mongo: Store session hash + encrypted tokens
    Go-->>User: Set HttpOnly BI_ENGINE_SESSION cookie
    User->>MFE: Open report designer
    MFE->>Go: iframe GET /api/superset/operation/
    Go->>Mongo: Load session and decrypt/refresh token
    Go->>SS: Proxy request with Authorization: Bearer token
    SS->>KC: Introspect token
    KC-->>SS: active=true + claims
    SS-->>User: Serve Superset without Superset login

